 ### SCENARIO-PHASE4-030
 **Description:** Running Exp 4021 either writes `complete: search_layer_solved_<game>_L<k>_real_env_confirmed` when the search plan advances beyond the prior single-step re-induction wall and the real environment confirms `levels_completed`, or writes `complete: search_layer_no_solve_<game>_L<k>_<bottleneck>` when the bounded search exhausts or hits a simulator/action-space bottleneck. A valid artifact MUST report whether search advanced past the prior stall, whether the wall was search rather than representation, the exact expansion count, the coded heuristic string, the real-env confirmation boolean, and the inference substrate used for the planner.
+
+### REQ-PHASE4-031: ARC GAP-4 Decentralization Gated By Local Best-of-N
+**Description:** The system SHALL run Exp 4022 as a data-driven decentralization gate over the Exp 4012 local best-of-N result before claiming either scaling or distillation viability. The runner MUST first read `results/experiment_4012_gap4_local_best_of_n.json`; if the file is missing, unreadable, or has an `honest_verdict` beginning with `blocked_`, it MUST write `results/experiment_4022_decentralization_gated.json` with `honest_verdict=blocked_exp4012_result_unavailable` and MUST NOT fabricate a branch. If Exp 4012 reports that local best-of-N beat vote or materially lifted demo-perfect induction coverage versus the three-attempt baseline, Exp 4022 SHALL take branch `A_scale` and reserve a bounded same-pool scaling confirmation. Otherwise it SHALL take branch `B_distill_feasibility`, harvest verifier-certified Codex induction traces into a fine-tune corpus only when they are demo-perfect and execution-validated, run only a tiny subset sanity fine-tune feasibility check, and report that the Invisible Leash caveat makes full distillation insufficient when Exp 4012 shows no latent local-support lift. The terminal artifact MUST include bare top-level fields `honest_verdict`, `branch_taken`, `exp4012_result_cited`, `decentralization_next_step`, and `inference_substrate`.
+
+### SCENARIO-PHASE4-031
+**Description:** Given Exp 4012 reports `local_beats_vote=false` and no material `coverage_gain_vs_3attempt`, running Exp 4022 MUST take `B_distill_feasibility`, cite the exact Exp 4012 fields that drove that branch, write a JSONL corpus of clean verifier-certified traces when cached Codex GAP-4 artifacts and the ARC demo pool are available, record corpus count and quality, and run a tiny deterministic subset sanity fine-tune proxy without claiming a full GGUF fine-tune. The `honest_verdict` MUST begin with a terminal prefix and name `B_distill_feasibility`; `decentralization_next_step` MUST state whether sovereignty should pursue a stronger local base or a bounded RLVR/Tulu-style sharpening pass based on the Exp 4012 latent-support diagnostic.
